  "scope": "The actual original degeneracy dispatcher executes the global empty-demand scan, then the real avoiding-path scan, and constructs the exact original infeasible demand, zero mask or positive witness tag. The actual child roots and original context share one append-only physical heap, and the complete paid bound uses original input sizes. Masks may be recomputed per visited query; no old logical count equality is claimed. Initial representations/widths, minimum-positive and guess preparation and the whole solver join remain separate."
